# Korus mobile native client workflow

Tasks touching `mobile/**`, Kotlin Multiplatform, Android/iOS native app, Maestro flows, `smoke-mobile-*.ps1`, mobile push/downloads/platform services:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/korus-mobile-orchestrator/SKILL.md` **FIRST**
2. Identify wave W0–W4 **before** editing files
3. Follow role phases and gates — spec `specs/032-mobile-native-client/`
4. **UI:** `DESIGNER` → `UX_EVALUATOR` **before** Engineer — full `mobile-ux-spec` (IA, menu vs screen), not ad-hoc buttons
5. **ENGINEER:** no `mobile/**` edits until `plan-review.status == APPROVED` **and** `ux-review.status == PASS` (or N/A SDK-only)

Designer subagent: `.cursor/agents/korus-mobile-designer.md`  
UX subagent: `.cursor/agents/korus-mobile-ux-evaluator.md`  
UX framework: `specs/032-mobile-native-client/design/mobile-ux-framework.md`

If task is **not** mobile native (webui responsive, backend-only, desktop Java): orchestrator exits quickly.

Engineer domain reference (after orchestrator routes to ENGINEER): `specs/032-mobile-native-client/research.md` + `mobile/mobile-client-sdk/`.

**Not mobile orchestrator:** responsive web shell in `webui/` → `korus-ui-orchestrator` + `korus-webui-mobile`.
